{"id":"mahabharata-3-189","work":"mahabharata","part":3,"partName":"आरण्यकपर्व","partNameEn":"Aranyaka Parva","unit":189,"title":"एकोननवत्यधिकशततमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 189 · Kalki and the return of the Krita age","summary":{"en":"Markandeya tells how Kalki will give the earth to the Brahmins and the Krita age will return. He then exhorts Yudhishthira to rule righteously, protecting his people and honouring Brahmins, and the Pandavas marvel at his ancient lore.","kn":"ಕಲ್ಕಿ ಭೂಮಿಯನ್ನು ಬ್ರಾಹ್ಮಣರಿಗೆ ಒಪ್ಪಿಸುವನು, ಕೃತಯುಗ ಮರಳುವುದು ಎಂದು ಮಾರ್ಕಂಡೇಯರು ಹೇಳುತ್ತಾರೆ. ಅನಂತರ ಪ್ರಜೆಗಳನ್ನು ಕಾಪಾಡಿ ಬ್ರಾಹ್ಮಣರನ್ನು ಗೌರವಿಸುತ್ತಾ ಧರ್ಮದಿಂದ ಆಳೆಂದು ಯುಧಿಷ್ಠಿರನಿಗೆ ಉಪದೇಶಿಸುತ್ತಾರೆ; ಪಾಂಡವರು ಅವರ ಪ್ರಾಚೀನ ಜ್ಞಾನಕ್ಕೆ ಬೆರಗಾಗುತ್ತಾರೆ.","hi":"मार्कण्डेय बताते हैं कि कल्कि पृथ्वी ब्राह्मणों को सौंपेंगे और कृतयुग लौटेगा। फिर वे युधिष्ठिर को प्रजा की रक्षा और ब्राह्मणों का सम्मान करते हुए धर्म से शासन करने का उपदेश देते हैं, और पाण्डव उनके प्राचीन ज्ञान पर चकित होते हैं।","te":"కల్కి భూమిని బ్రాహ్మణులకు అప్పగిస్తాడని, కృతయుగం తిరిగివస్తుందని మార్కండేయుడు చెబుతాడు. తర్వాత ప్రజలను కాపాడుతూ బ్రాహ్మణులను గౌరవిస్తూ ధర్మంగా పాలించమని యుధిష్ఠిరునికి ఉపదేశిస్తాడు; పాండవులు ఆయన ప్రాచీన జ్ఞానానికి ఆశ్చర్యపోతారు.","ta":"கல்கி பூமியை அந்தணர்களிடம் ஒப்படைப்பார், க்ருத யுகம் திரும்பும் என்று மார்க்கண்டேயர் சொல்கிறார். பின்னர் மக்களைக் காத்து அந்தணர்களைக் கௌரவித்து அறவழியில் ஆளுமாறு யுதிஷ்டிரருக்கு அறிவுரை சொல்ல, பாண்டவர்கள் அவரின் பழமையான ஞானத்தைக் கண்டு வியக்கிறார்கள்.","ml":"കൽക്കി ഭൂമി ബ്രാഹ്മണർക്ക് നൽകുമെന്നും കൃതയുഗം തിരിച്ചുവരുമെന്നും മാർക്കണ്ഡേയൻ പറയുന്നു. പിന്നെ പ്രജകളെ സംരക്ഷിച്ച്, ബ്രാഹ്മണരെ ബഹുമാനിച്ച്, ധർമ്മത്തോടെ ഭരിക്കാൻ അദ്ദേഹം യുധിഷ്ഠിരനെ ഉപദേശിക്കുന്നു; പാണ്ഡവർ അദ്ദേഹത്തിന്റെ പുരാതന അറിവിൽ അത്ഭുതപ്പെടുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 3.189; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Mon Apr 11 2022","sections":[{"title":"मार्कण्डेयसमास्यापर्व","titleEn":"Markandeyasamasya Parva (Session with Markandeya)","verses":[{"text":"मार्कण्डेय उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Markandeya said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"ततश्चोरक्षयं कृत्वा द्विजेभ्यः पृथिवीमिमाम् ।\nवाजिमेधे महायज्ञे विधिवत्कल्पयिष्यति ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then, having wiped out the robbers, he will arrange for the brahmins to receive this earth in a great horse sacrifice, as the rule requires."}},{"n":2,"text":"स्थापयित्वा स मर्यादाः स्वयम्भुविहिताः शुभाः ।\nवनं पुण्ययशःकर्मा जरावान्संश्रयिष्यति ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having set up the good boundaries laid down by the Self-born, that man of holy fame and deeds will in his old age retire to the forest."}},{"n":3,"text":"तच्छीलमनुवर्त्स्यन्ते मनुष्या लोकवासिनः ।\nविप्रैश्चोरक्षये चैव कृते क्षेमं भविष्यति ॥","meaning":{"en":"People living in the world will follow his way of life, and with the robbers destroyed through the brahmins, there will be safety."}},{"n":4,"text":"कृष्णाजिनानि शक्तीश्च त्रिशूलान्यायुधानि च ।\nस्थापयन्विप्रशार्दूलो देशेषु विजितेषु च ॥","meaning":{"en":"That tiger among brahmins will set up black antelope skins, spears, tridents and weapons in the conquered lands."}},{"n":5,"text":"संस्तूयमानो विप्रेन्द्रैर्मानयानो द्विजोत्तमान् ।\nकल्किश्चरिष्यति महीं सदा दस्युवधे रतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Praised by the best of brahmins and honouring the best of the twice-born, Kalki will go over the earth, always busy killing bandits."}},{"n":6,"text":"हा तात हा सुतेत्येवं तास्ता वाचः सुदारुणाः ।\nविक्रोशमानान्सुभृशं दस्यून्नेष्यति संक्षयम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"The bandits, crying out most loudly those dreadful words, \"Alas, father! Alas, son!\", he will bring to destruction."}},{"n":7,"text":"ततोऽधर्मविनाशो वै धर्मवृद्धिश्च भारत ।\nभविष्यति कृते प्राप्ते क्रियावांश्च जनस्तथा ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then, Bharata, unrighteousness will be destroyed and dharma will grow once the Krita age arrives, and people will do their duties."}},{"n":8,"text":"आरामाश्चैव चैत्याश्च तटाकान्यवटास्तथा ।\nयज्ञक्रियाश्च विविधा भविष्यन्ति कृते युगे ॥","meaning":{"en":"In the Krita age there will be gardens, shrines, ponds and wells, and many kinds of sacrificial rites."}},{"n":9,"text":"ब्राह्मणाः साधवश्चैव मुनयश्च तपस्विनः ।\nआश्रमाः सहपाषण्डाः स्थिताः सत्ये जनाः प्रजाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Brahmins, holy men, sages and ascetics, hermitages and sects, and the people at large will stand in truth."}},{"n":10,"text":"जास्यन्ति सर्वबीजानि उप्यमानानि चैव ह ।\nसर्वेष्वृतुषु राजेन्द्र सर्वं सस्यं भविष्यति ॥","meaning":{"en":"All seeds that are sown will sprout; in every season, great king, every crop will grow."}},{"n":11,"text":"नरा दानेषु निरता व्रतेषु नियमेषु च ।\nजपयज्ञपरा विप्रा धर्मकामा मुदा युताः ।\nपालयिष्यन्ति राजानो धर्मेणेमां वसुंधराम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"People will delight in giving, vows and restraints; brahmins, devoted to prayer and sacrifice and eager for dharma, will be joyful; and kings will rule this earth by dharma."}},{"n":12,"text":"व्यवहाररता वैश्या भविष्यन्ति कृते युगे ।\nषट्कर्मनिरता विप्राः क्षत्रिया रक्षणे रताः ॥","meaning":{"en":"In the Krita age merchants will be devoted to trade, brahmins to their six duties and warriors to protection."}},{"n":13,"text":"शुश्रूषायां रताः शूद्रास्तथा वर्णत्रयस्य च ।\nएष धर्मः कृतयुगे त्रेतायां द्वापरे तथा ।\nपश्चिमे युगकाले च यः स ते संप्रकीर्तितः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Servants will be devoted to serving the other three classes. This is the dharma of the Krita age, as also of the Treta and Dvapara and the last age, which I have declared to you."}},{"n":14,"text":"सर्वलोकस्य विदिता युगसंख्या च पाण्डव ।\nएतत्ते सर्वमाख्यातमतीतानागतं मया ।\nवायुप्रोक्तमनुस्मृत्य पुराणमृषिसंस्तुतम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"The count of the ages is known to the whole world, son of Pandu. I have told you all this, past and future, recalling the ancient account spoken by Vayu and praised by seers."}},{"n":15,"text":"एवं संसारमार्गा मे बहुशश्चिरजीविना ।\nदृष्टाश्चैवानुभूताश्च तांस्ते कथितवानहम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"In this way I, long-lived, have often seen and experienced the paths of the cycle of rebirth, and have told them to you."}},{"n":16,"text":"इदं चैवापरं भूयः सह भ्रातृभिरच्युत ।\nधर्मसंशयमोक्षार्थं निबोध वचनं मम ॥","meaning":{"en":"Now hear one more thing from me, together with your brothers, steadfast one, to resolve your doubts about dharma."}},{"n":17,"text":"धर्मे त्वयात्मा संयोज्यो नित्यं धर्मभृतां वर ।\nधर्मात्मा हि सुखं राजा प्रेत्य चेह च नन्दति ॥","meaning":{"en":"You should always fix yourself in dharma, best of those who uphold it; a righteous king rejoices here and after death."}},{"n":18,"text":"निबोध च शुभां वाणीं यां प्रवक्ष्यामि तेऽनघ ।\nन ब्राह्मणे परिभवः कर्तव्यस्ते कदाचन ।\nब्राह्मणो रुषितो हन्यादपि लोकान्प्रतिज्ञया ॥","meaning":{"en":"Hear also the good counsel I will give you, blameless one: you should never show contempt to a brahmin, for an angered brahmin may, by his vow, destroy even the worlds."}},{"text":"वैशंपायन उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Vaishampayana said:"}},{"n":19,"text":"मार्कण्डेयवचः श्रुत्वा कुरूणां प्रवरो नृपः ।\nउवाच वचनं धीमान्परमं परमद्युतिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having heard Markandeya's words, the intelligent king, best of the Kurus and of great splendour, spoke an excellent reply."}},{"n":20,"text":"कस्मिन्धर्मे मया स्थेयं प्रजाः संरक्षता मुने ।\nकथं च वर्तमानो वै न च्यवेयं स्वधर्मतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"By what dharma should I abide, sage, while protecting my subjects, and how may I live without falling from my own duty?"}},{"text":"मार्कण्डेय उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Markandeya said:"}},{"n":21,"text":"दयावान्सर्वभूतेषु हितो रक्तोऽनसूयकः ।\nअपत्यानामिव स्वेषां प्रजानां रक्षणे रतः ।\nचर धर्मं त्यजाधर्मं पितॄन्देवांश्च पूजय ॥","meaning":{"en":"Be compassionate to all beings, devoted to their good and free of envy, intent on protecting your subjects as if they were your own children. Follow dharma, abandon unrighteousness, and honour your ancestors and the gods."}},{"n":22,"text":"प्रमादाद्यत्कृतं तेऽभूत्संयग्दानेन तज्जय ।\nअलं ते मानमाश्रित्य सततं परवान्भव ॥","meaning":{"en":"Overcome by generous giving whatever fault you committed through carelessness. Enough of pride; always be dependent on others' good."}},{"n":23,"text":"विजित्य पृथिवीं सर्वां मोदमानः सुखी भव ।\nएष भूतो भविष्यश्च धर्मस्ते समुदीरितः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having conquered the whole earth, be glad and happy. This dharma, of past and future, has been declared to you."}},{"n":24,"text":"न तेऽस्त्यविदितं किंचिदतीतानागतं भुवि ।\nतस्मादिमं परिक्लेशं त्वं तात हृदि मा कृथाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"There is nothing on earth, past or future, that you do not know, dear one; so do not take this distress to heart."}},{"n":25,"text":"एष कालो महाबाहो अपि सर्वदिवौकसाम् ।\nमुह्यन्ति हि प्रजास्तात कालेनाभिप्रचोदिताः ॥","meaning":{"en":"This time, mighty-armed one, bewilders even all the dwellers of heaven; people, driven by time, are confused."}},{"n":26,"text":"मा च तेऽत्र विचारो भूद्यन्मयोक्तं तवानघ ।\nअतिशङ्क्य वचो ह्येतद्धर्मलोपो भवेत्तव ॥","meaning":{"en":"Do not doubt what I have told you here, blameless one; by distrusting these words you might lose dharma."}},{"n":27,"text":"जातोऽसि प्रथिते वंशे कुरूणां भरतर्षभ ।\nकर्मणा मनसा वाचा सर्वमेतत्समाचर ॥","meaning":{"en":"You were born in the famed line of the Kurus, best of the Bharatas; carry out all this in deed, thought and word."}},{"text":"युधिष्ठिर उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Yudhishthira said:"}},{"n":28,"text":"यत्त्वयोक्तं द्विजश्रेष्ठ वाक्यं श्रुतिमनोहरम् ।\nतथा करिष्ये यत्नेन भवतः शासनं विभो ॥","meaning":{"en":"What you have said, best of brahmins, is delightful to hear; I will carry out your command with effort, lord."}},{"n":29,"text":"न मे लोभोऽस्ति विप्रेन्द्र न भयं न च मत्सरः ।\nकरिष्यामि हि तत्सर्वमुक्तं यत्ते मयि प्रभो ॥","meaning":{"en":"I have no greed, best of brahmins, no fear and no malice; I will do everything you have said to me, master."}},{"text":"वैशंपायन उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Vaishampayana said:"}},{"n":30,"text":"श्रुत्वा तु वचनं तस्य पाण्डवस्य महात्मनः ।\nप्रहृष्टाः पाण्डवा राजन्सहिताः शार्ङ्गधन्वना ॥","meaning":{"en":"Hearing the words of the great-souled Pandava, the Pandavas, together with Krishna, wielder of the Sharnga bow, were delighted, king."}},{"n":31,"text":"तथा कथां शुभां श्रुत्वा मार्कण्डेयस्य धीमतः ।\nविस्मिताः समपद्यन्त पुराणस्य निवेदनात् ॥","meaning":{"en":"And hearing the good story told by the wise Markandeya, they were struck with wonder at this account of ancient things."}}]}]}